","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_7","text":"the Counters have performed the best.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_8","text":"Oh, I'm perfectly aware of how capable they are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_9","text":"I imagine you would. After all, you've even spoken to members of the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_10","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_11","text":"The Counters are a Special Commando unit, so they've had to carry out all sorts of classified missions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_12","text":"There's a bunch of information about them which isn't known to the public either. Almost as much as the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_13","text":"Every time they've gone up against a Heretic, they've come out on top.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_14","text":"Not every time. I'm pretty sure there were times that they were defeated or had to retreat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_15","text":"Okay, but if we exclude tactical retreats and successful withdrawals, they're undefeated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_16","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_17","text":"Hold on, how do you know all this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_18","text":"When we first went up against a Heretic, I thought we were done for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_19","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_20","text":"Eventually, we got better and better.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_21","text":"We worked more and more as a team, and everyone became stronger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_22","text":"And above all... oh, I assume you've heard about Vapaus?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_23","text":"I have. The commander of the Counters used it to defeat Nihilister.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_24","text":"But apparently, it's no silver bullet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_25","text":"If only the commander of the Counters","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_26","text":"was able to make more of that stuff...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_27","text":"Hmm. Looks like not everything was recorded.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_28","text":"Arcana's gaze fixates on the name tag on my chest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_29","text":"Then we could have already reclaimed the sur...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_30","text":"Wait a second!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_31","text":"You've got the same name as the commander of the Counters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_33","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_33","text":"Arcana redirects her focus on my face.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_34","text":"And your face... it's awfully similar to what I saw during the attack on the Ark...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_35","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_36","text":"How interesting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_37","text":"You must be his doppelganger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_38","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_39","text":"... Or his brother?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_40","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_41","text":"Are you serious?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_42","text":"You're him?! You're the commander of the Counters?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_43","text":"... Hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_44","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_44","text":"I puff my chest out as much as I can and flash my most dashing smile.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_impression","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_45","text":"Nice to meet you. I'm {AccountData.NickName}, the commander of the Counters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_46","text":"It's always nice meeting a fan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_47","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_48","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_48","text":"It takes Arcana about 20 minutes to accept reality.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_49","text":"Have you never seen a photo of me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_50","text":"My job usually consists of transcribing mission reports that come my way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_51","text":"I know your general description, but as far as actually seeing your face,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_52","text":"it was only once, briefly during the attack on the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_53","text":"Phantom brought you to the Outpost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_54","text":"I'm the only commander at the Outpost, aren't I?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_55","text":"My mind was all scrambled then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_56","text":"I had no idea whether I was at the Outpost, the Ark, or on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_57","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_57","text":"You didn't seem all that out of sorts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_58","text":"Just because someone doesn't show doesn't mean they're not hurting inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_59","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_60","text":"Still though...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_61","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_62","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_63","text":"Nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_64","text":"I just wondered if you were actually real.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_06_s_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_06_s_65","text":"Well, as you can see, I'm very much real.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie